        "excerptDigest": "sha256-504a82f7e3fb48b29014c4fab206b0785ca7ec2d6ace54f50f88344a82e3b4b2"
      },
      "text": "EqualCellsCounter makes at most n (= O(n)) calls to a Sigma_3^P oracle and calls no other oracle",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-ddb96bebc98c3f50eb68bf7e4e9e863715cf42485e14b67d3c3d4a1a420c557b",
      "kind": "resource",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "bgp.tex",
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-504a82f7e3fb48b29014c4fab206b0785ca7ec2d6ace54f50f88344a82e3b4b2"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:3255836e-c474-45c0-8ce3-bf34e39e13d2",
      "claimId": "claim:066bcd7e-c536-4d4b-bac5-cc6a76ca0137",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:2e120744-dc04-42ae-8a96-90f426edd456",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "bgp.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-52877fa6904fc5a83ba8d577a1c7352f195602dcf96cc66209da31ac6106774a"
      },
      "text": "If the check at line:eqcells-check passes at m, then l 2^m <= |sol F| <= u 2^m (Proposition prop:bgp)",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-9250633a114a91fe7642d3bdc02b7e137dd667b9cab443f19c8c80a2014b4b98",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "bgp.tex",
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-52877fa6904fc5a83ba8d577a1c7352f195602dcf96cc66209da31ac6106774a"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:85f47030-10d5-4a70-97cd-14b2dbb8ffb9",
      "claimId": "claim:d042132e-2a4a-4229-a240-6647efede2bd",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:2e120744-dc04-42ae-8a96-90f426edd456",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "bgp.tex",
        "from": 111,
        "to": 113,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-c901f8d5e8ad65563d15cb1b36f4f8404b218b51072f374ac2e87604d8cf6fe4"
      },
      "text": "u/l = 16 gives |sol F|/16 <= CntEst <= |sol F|",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-2c2f71bf1137bedaeed712b7bbdd0a033a15674bc557d509b0048eb1fb38dfdf",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "bgp.tex",
          "from": 111,
          "to": 113,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-c901f8d5e8ad65563d15cb1b36f4f8404b218b51072f374ac2e87604d8cf6fe4"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:20cc6457-d276-4796-9fee-cee376809bda",
      "claimId": "claim:48a31026-af7d-4b8e-897f-092307388d32",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:2e120744-dc04-42ae-8a96-90f426edd456",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "bgp.tex",
        "from": 117,
        "to": 135,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-dd9634d182f998f7828e4c411089b11969131156bfc205ce2d2cfa2370ff15a2"
      },
      "text": "Some m in [1,n] passes: at m0 = floor(log2|sol F| - 12 - log2 n), mu = |sol F|/2^m0 is in [4096n, 8192n], and with h <-R H(n,m0,n), Pr[some cell outside [l,u]] <= 8(2/31)^n < 1",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-ede92c7b70ddfa8a7b61fc85be0905c9a3094043ee49ff9307a1f3063e43346b",
      "kind": "probability",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "bgp.tex",
          "from": 117,
          "to": 135,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-dd9634d182f998f7828e4c411089b11969131156bfc205ce2d2cfa2370ff15a2"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:9a9e80f6-43b3-41bf-99b5-6f4ced7b2d87",
      "claimId": "claim:3af1f6be-0e27-48c2-b41e-56b2591ba32c",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:2e120744-dc04-42ae-8a96-90f426edd456",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "bgp.tex",
        "from": 103,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-a929917babf4dbaa7a1ba153441887b5feb86b4d2cb9e295c3a64c384b049e6d"
      },
      "text": "Hence EqualCellsCounter solves DAC (16-factor)",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-17fc844bd3b9b546c2a0d94bb237615dcb34b4ebad5a17517bc2714f148c408e",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
