      },
      "text": "'Solves DAC' holds for every F: false; needs |sol F| >= 8192 n (proof) and in any case >= 2048 n",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-92837ca8ad670868cf277bbd73e3d427fb6ea641b920eda3f6bc97754933ef48",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
